Package: Cohort2Trajectory
Type: Package
Title: Create Patient Trajectories from Clinical Cohorts
Version: 1.3.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Markus", "Haug", email = "markus.haug@ut.ee",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0935-3307")),
    person("Greete Kelli", "Aava", email = "greete.kelli.aava@ut.ee",
           role = "ctb"),
    person("Raivo", "Kolde", email = "raivo.kolde@ut.ee",
           role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2886-6298")))
Description: Constructs discrete and continuous patient histories from
    analyst-defined cohort intervals. Resolves overlapping states using explicit
    priorities, transition rules and structured state membership, while retaining
    patient identifiers and observation boundaries. Accepts local data or cohorts
    generated with 'CDMConnector' in the Observational Medical Outcomes Partnership
    (OMOP) Common Data Model. Saves reusable study settings and returns trajectory
    tables for subsequent analysis.
